17
00:00:28,040 --> 00:00:30,120
Mom and dad are here for dinner

18
00:00:30,240 --> 00:00:31,440
I am dependent

19
00:00:31,440 --> 00:00:32,440
I never ate it again

20
00:00:32,440 --> 00:00:33,960
Such a normal meal

21
00:00:33,960 --> 00:00:34,960
That boss Xia

22
00:00:34,960 --> 00:00:36,200
We also want to buy a box of lunch

23
00:00:36,200 --> 00:00:38,560
Of course it’s okay if everyone in the family hasn’t eaten for a long time.

24
00:00:38,560 --> 00:00:39,680
But each family only gets one box first

25
00:00:39,680 --> 00:00:40,600
I didn't take much today

26
00:00:40,600 --> 00:00:42,600
Just one box. Just have it. Thank you, boss.
